<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1301 0 R
/E (Medical representatives act as the primary link between pharmaceutical companies and healthcare professionals, promoting products such as drugs and medical equipment. They engage with doctors, nurses, and pharmacists to raise awareness, answer questions, and build strong relationships. A key challenge for medical representatives is convincing doctors to prescribe their company's drug over competitors with the same active ingredients. Success in this role requires effectively communicating the product's advantages and fostering trust with healthcare professionals.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
